  "descriptions": [
    "As soon as you pull up to this luxury beachfront stunner, you’ll feel instantly at ease, lulled by the tranquil blue hues, bright and open design, huge walls of windows, endless decks, and uninterrupted Gulf views.",
    "Living Spaces\nThe open design of Blue Hideaway’s living space is simply breathtaking. Vaulted ceilings and an enormous wall of windows displaying blue sky, white sand, and the sparkling Gulf of Mexico give the feeling of never-ending space, while beachy hues and decor match the stunning beachfront setting. Lost in a sea of blue and white, you can’t help but relax on comfy sofas and armchairs in the large open space. An enormous flatscreen TV will keep you entertained – if you can tear your eyes away from the views.",
    "Kitchen & Dining\nOpen to the living area, the beautifully-designed kitchen features an enormous kitchen island where everyone can gather – it’s got an incredible eight seats. White shaker-style cabinets, gleaming countertops, and stainless steel appliances make the kitchen both functional and inviting. A distressed wood dining table that seats 6-7 people with bench seating invites hearty meals, fun game nights, and memorable conversations."
  ],
  "roomDetails": [
    "Bedroom 1: Primary suite, King bed, flatscreen TV, sliders to deck with steps down to the sand, and ensuite bathroom\nBedroom 2: Queen bed, flatscreen TV, sliders to deck, large dresser",
